WEBVTT

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.640
Now then,

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:30.340
this briefing will cover our attack
operation we'll soon be launching.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.610
<i>You are not supposed to waste your time here.</i>

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.280
<i>What he said yesterday...</i>

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.560
<i>What was that all about?</i>

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.250
Watase Aoba, Private Second Class.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.070
Private Second Class?

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:02.090
I, Ensign Ogisaka Saburouta, will be the instructor

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:05.220
in charge of Ensign Watase's new recruit training, starting today.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.750
And I, Corporal Nasu Mayuka, will be his assistant.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.350
Eh?

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:16.870
Spread your wings

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:21.500
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.800
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:30.180
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:39.440
That world you see before your eyes

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:45.030
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.490
The pain of loss isn't something

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.450
You want to get used to, and yet

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:57.410
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:04.380
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.220
Can't go back

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.630
Want to go home

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.970
The two of them back-to-back

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:13.010
Break through

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:17.770
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:21.110
Like painting over a colorless world

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:23.820
Let this sympathy reach

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:30.070
Let's build the future that we envision

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.280
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:38.080
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.220
These are the application forms for the usage of Chitose Base,

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.600
ship resupply and the inventory list.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.520
And the reports from our previous battle, too.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.730
Please sign these after reading through them.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:56.650
Can't I just sign the documents without reviewing them?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.990
Absolutely not.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.240
There is still highly classified information on board.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.740
That's just another reason why we must follow standard procedures.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.990
I'm at a loss for words with you.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.000
Repairs to the ship will be finished soon.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.750
I've received a report that Lieutenant Conrad is on his way to a full recovery.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.630
That's a relief.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:19.550
What are the two most important,
classified pilots in our army doing?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.590
Shall I bring them in?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.640
Nope. Just asking.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:27.140
Ensign Weinberg is inspecting the machine
and working on his physical training.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.060
Ensign Watase is with Ensign Ogisaka and Corporal Nasu.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.900
Could it be... <i>that</i>?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.900
Yes, it is.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.320
C'mon, don't make that face.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.350
It's always been our tradition.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:43.860
To be a soldier you have to know the basics,
understand one another, obey the rules

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:47.030
and undergo daily training to prepare for emergency situations.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:48.950
What is this?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.450
It's as you have heard.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.410
We've already received approval from the captain.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.870
Oh, no.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.250
We have the approval of the captain, Ensign Watase.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.760
Listen up! Right now, you're not even fit to be called human!

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:06.050
If you're able to survive my training,
then you'll be able to call yourself a soldier.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.680
Until then, all I want to hear from you is "Yes, Sir!" or "No, Sir!"

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.810
Understand, you piece of trash?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.060
I'm heading back!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.230
Please hold on!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.560
You know,

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.280
you just got promoted yesterday.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.000
Since you're still relatively new to the ship,

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.820
we thought we'd show you the ropes
under the guise of "new recruit training".

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.580
I understand.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.290
After this training,

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.790
everyone will acknowledge you as a reserve ensign.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.500
Now then, take your weapon, Ensign Watase Aoba.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.090
Weapon?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.670
You're not allowed to laugh or cry!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.930
You are the "Clean It Up Machine"!

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:47.890
You're worthless unless you're cleaning!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.390
Don't slack off!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.600
You're just pretending to be tired to get some attention!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.350
You good-for-nothing loser!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.730
If you hate me, so be it.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.730
Your hate will only make you stronger.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.870
But ensure you remember this:

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.690
always obey the orders of your superiors!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:10.660
That being said, Ensign Watase,
help Lieutenant Conrad with his urine bottle.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.830
The hell did you say?!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.290
I have rejoined my squad.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.550
I was informed that I was able to return only because you spoke on my behalf.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.180
Thank you very much.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.890
There's no need to thank me,

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.060
although it seems like something is still troubling you.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.140
They're still suspicious of me.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:41.360
You can prove your innocence through your actions.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.990
However, don't allow that determination to take precedence over your duties.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.320
Yes, sir!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.280
Hina.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.710
Bizon.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:53.660
Are you okay?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.950
I'm okay.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.960
As an agent of the Secret Services, she's always been like that.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.170
You can't be serious.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:10.680
Do they expect me to clean this by myself?!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.750
Well then, we have other duties to attend to.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.350
When you've finished, head over to the bridge.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.850
Don't goof off.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.770
As if I'd do that!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.610
Isn't she...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.780
We cannot allow you to board the ship without special permission.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.450
Regulations forbid it.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.540
But…

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.910
It's against regulations.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.900
Fiona-sama...

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.460
It's okay. Let's go.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.550
Hey!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.510
Ah, I knew it.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.680
You're that person from before.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.020
I'm Watase Aoba, Luxon's pilot.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.480
You're Dio's...

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.690
Little sister. I'm Fiona Weinberg.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.520
Should I call him?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.440
You're here to see him, right?

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.360
No, it's okay.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.700
After what Father said,

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.410
Dio wouldn't want to see me.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.580
What do you mean by that?

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.660
Dio feels indebted to me.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.420
No... To us, our family.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.460
Indebted?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.380
Yes.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.310
There's too many of them.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.060
Unit No. 7, retreat!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:46.770
Captain!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.570
The enemy has broken through the perimeter!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.780
Units 1 and 2 have already withdrawn.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.780
We don't stand a chance here.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.700
But Mom and Fiona are still there!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.410
Let go of me! I can still…

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.470
Mom!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.430
Fiona!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.890
Because of that attack, we lost our mother and my legs.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.810
I can't believe it.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:28.020
We were up against a large enemy force.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.110
That's why I believe no one's truly at fault.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.240
But Father blames Dio,

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:36.530
and Dio blames himself because of Mother and I.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.990
I'm worried about him.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.000
Okay. I got it.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.120
What's wrong?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.300
M-My stomach suddenly hurts...

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.550
Hang in there, I'll call the medical division.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:02.430
I'm fine. It'll go away soon. Probably.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.230
Hey, are you sure you're okay?

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:10.770
I really think we should call the medical team.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.150
I-I'm fine.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.280
But, you…

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.320
Is this really okay?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.410
What is?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.870
You'll get scolded later, Aoba-san.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.040
You shouldn't have to get permission to see your own family.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.000
If there's someone you want to talk to,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.500
then it's better to talk to them while you still have the chance.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.690
Anyway, where's that Dio?

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.760
Maybe we'll know if we go to the bridge.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.720
Welcome to Cygnus.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.020
Huh?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.680
Who's that girl?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.400
Oh, Dio's little sister and her guardian.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.110
So anyway...

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.320
What's all this?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.610
Aoba-san's welcome party.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.320
We always do this when there's a newcomer.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.740
It's our tradition.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.200
I went through this when I first got here.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.000
All that talk about the "new recruit training"
and they even made me clean up whole ship.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.540
Then all of that...

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.120
Don't hate me.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.790
I was practically forced to do it since everyone asked me to.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.000
Forced to?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.880
He was actually really enthusiastic about it.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.210
He watches too many movies, you know what I mean?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:15.920
Shut up!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.850
C'mon now, hurry up and wear this.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:21.600
This is the last of the traditions.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:25.020
Thank you very much, Aoba-san.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:29.390
I feel much happier knowing what kind of people Dio works with.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.830
Then should we call for Dio?

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:37.940
Once he heard it was your welcome party, he refused to participate.

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.910
What's with him?

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.040
Patch it to the Training Room.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:52.420
Dio.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.380
Fiona! Why are you here?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.210
I brought her here.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:58.090
Why did you?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.840
Come to the bridge.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.180
I don't mind if you don't come to my welcome party,

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.850
but you should at least talk to Fiona.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:06.810
Dio?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.960
Emergency transmission from the defense forces at the Otaru base.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.420
The Zogilian forces have invaded the Sea of Japan.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.800
They're currently engaged in battle.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.720
They have twice as many aerial forces as we do.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.760
Send as many reinforcements to them as possible.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.970
Especially from Chitose. Empty the base if you have to.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.430
What about that ship?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.510
Of course.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.850
That was the whole point of the new-types,
so they could be used in situations like these.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.610
What? We also have to join the battle?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.770
The engines are still undergoing repairs.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.230
Is that alright?

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.950
Aren't this ship and the Coupling System supposed to be top secret?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.780
But it's an order, right?

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.830
Yes, a direct order from the
Commanding General of the Alliance.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:07.950
Then we have no choice.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:13.040
Set a course for the Otaru Base at full speed.

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:16.810
Our objective is to support our allies currently under attack

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.210
and to halt the enemy invasion.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.630
Valiancer team, prepare for launch.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.470
I'm off first.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.470
Including this ship, our forces are comprised of eight allied ships.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.930
We will rendezvous with the allied forces ahead of us.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.310
All hands, standby at your stations until we reach the rendezvous point.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:31.770
Dio.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.980
Fiona, why are you still here?

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.270
I'm sorry. There's something I
wanted to tell you no matter what.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.270
What is it?

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:43.610
Dio, you did nothing wrong.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:50.200
Even if other people blame you,
I will always forgive you.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.200
Fiona-sama, let's get going.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.620
See you later, Dio.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.470
Ships no 1 and 2, lift off in sequence.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.550
Once airborne, change to the secondary speed…

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.390
What was that?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.890
A number of mechas are approaching from 6 o'clock!

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:16.770
They're Zogilian Valiancers!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.360
I won't let you support the forces at Otaru Base.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.610
Our unit

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.530
will join the main forces which will
be attacking from the Sea of Japan

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.740
in order to capture and neutralize Chitose Base.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.450
Do not lay a finger on the private ship.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.910
Who would do such a cowardly thing?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.960
I wonder how long their defenses will last
against our attacks without additional support.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.170
We will take Chitose Base.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.700
Now you've done it, Alfried Gallant.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.660
What should we do, Captain?

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.040
We have no other choice.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.040
We'll have to take care of the enemies here first.

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:22.880
Tell the Commanding General that the situation has changed.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.550
Cygnus, emergency take off.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.930
All hands, engage battle mode No. 1.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.890
After commencing the attack, Valiancer units will…

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:33.890
What about Fiona?

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:39.190
We've just received word that Fiona has safely boarded Weinberg's ship.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.230
Is that so?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.150
Thank goodness.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.610
You guys are completely synchronized.

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.900
Bradyon, launching.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.540
Fiona and everyone else are safe,
there's no need to hold back now.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.000
Idiot, don't fly off alone!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.170
I've found you, white mecha!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.170
That mecha is...

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.130
Hina?

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.550
Aoba?

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.760
That idiot…

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.390
Hina, don't go on your own!
It's too dangerous!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.440
Let her be.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.440
If she captures the new-type,
we will no longer be suspicious of her.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.820
It also meets our national strategy.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.690
They're still suspicious?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.910
It's your fault that I'm still under suspicion!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.950
Hina, it's me, Aoba. Can't you see?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.660
Death to Zogilia's enemy!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.770
Dio.

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.840
Aoba-san.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.300
That guy.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.510
Just go ahead if you're worried, Dio.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:57.600
But the enemy's main force...

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.060
You're not being honest.

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.850
Dio, this is the captain's order.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:05.560
To turn the tables, activate Coupling with Aoba-san.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.570
See, it's your call.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.990
Don't interfere.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.410
You barbaric fools.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.250
Enemy incoming from 6 o'clock.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.670
Activating the rear Nectar Curtain.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.170
The engine's output is stable,

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.420
damage is minimal!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.590
Where's Dio?

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:31.840
He's still hasn't entered the Seventh Code Coverage.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.300
What's the matter?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.260
Numerous enemies are approaching us from behind.

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.690
Checking the data.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.560
They're Zogilian forces.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:43.100
Eleven Coltar units, 25 Frandell units, and dozens of Valiancers.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.900
Five minutes until they reach Chitose Base.

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:48.190
They've broken through the defense forces, huh?

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.440
Wait a second.

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.190
The ship at the front.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.200
That is…

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.590
That's not fair.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.340
Strike them down in a single blow.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.180
Hey, isn't this...

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.300
We're caught between a rock and a hard place. We've nowhere to run.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.560
Captain, it's impossible to protect the base now.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.770
We can't hold out much longer with them attacking us from two sides.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.070
Okay.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.190
We're abandoning Chitose Base.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.570
This ship will leave the area.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.410
But how?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.070
Maybe if we use that.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.830
Both of them may be able to do it now.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:42.490
Captain!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.710
Stop it, Hina! Please stop!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.790
You were the one who brought me here,

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.460
so why?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.420
You're not attacking at all.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.130
Are you looking down on me?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.890
Die!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:02.720
What?

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.680
Dio!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.070
Damn it.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.110
I can't get any closer.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.530
Wait! Hina is inside that mecha!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.610
Cut it out.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.820
You're really an idiot for not attacking.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.080
But Hina...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.790
Dio, Aoba-kun, listen up.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:27.540
The Cygnus is abandoning Chitose Base and will withdraw.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.500
Hey, hey, is that alright?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.710
We've received permission from the Commanding General.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.420
Then let's get the hell outta here.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.380
They're not chasing?

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.430
But with this method,

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.050
other than the essential Buddy rapport and combination,

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.680
the burden of the Aeroscale will be too much to handle.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.140
It can only be used once in a limited time.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.230
You heard her.

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.150
There's no time to be obsessed with that mecha!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.900
Understood.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.240
Then I'll do the chasing!

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:58.950
Connect with Dio!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.200
Accept.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.120
That is...

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.200
Oh, no!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.330
They're running away?

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.290
They're making a fool out of me!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:16.920
They're too fast.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.260
I can't keep up!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.740
Luxon and Bradyon.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.400
They're at the specified location.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.620
30 seconds is the limit.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.370
Be careful, both of you.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.330
We've reached the critical limit!

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:52.170
Cygnus, follow Luxon and Bradyon at maximum speed.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.590
Activate Code T2 Rise!

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:58.420
Let's do it.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:19:59.010
Yeah!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.100
They're heading straight towards us?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.970
What a bold strategy.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.480
What do they want?

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.390
I'll try to figure it out.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:16.440
What?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.360
It bounced off?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.000
Don't slam that into me.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.380
I'm doing fine, aren't I?

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.760
At least be honest if you want me to back you up!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.170
What is with your attitude?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.430
Time's up.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.230
Fire!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.130
What are you doing?!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.380
After them. Now!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.010
It's no use.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.840
We've accomplished our objective.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.550
We'll now capture and neutralize Chitose Base.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.350
Father, Dio protected us.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.440
And he's surrounded by wonderful people.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.780
How're my engine control skills?

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.080
It has nothing to do with this.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:51.950
What?

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.660
The rest is up to you, Lieutenant Commander.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:56.620
Yes, sir.

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.920
You reckless people.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.670
Hurry up and come down here!

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:11.600
Thanks for looking after my sister, Aoba.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:20.760
With my heart, I call out

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:25.140
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:29.650
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:34.280
Just for now, please

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:38.450
I know you

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:42.950
I'm searching for you

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:45.410
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:52.050
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:52.050 --> 00:23:00.600
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:05.180
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:09.730
and the times I have wondered

00:23:09.730 --> 00:23:13.980
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:16.240
I want to save you,

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:18.320
I want to protect you

00:23:18.320 --> 00:23:22.700
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:25.580
Wait for me

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:30.330
The love we'll surely find

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:35.130
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:37.510 --> 00:23:39.930
Next episode, on Buddy Complex:

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:41.980
"The Other Coupler."
